F18-1 [proposed] Endpoint-mode turns cannot prove they did not bill the local subscription: init apiKeySource 'none' is the expected value on the endpoint route (P8/P10) and also the subscription's value, and the adapter explicitly records it raw and fails only on ANTHROPIC_API_KEY â€” so a silent same-model fallback to the signed-in login is indistinguishable in the ledger.
F18-2 [proposed] A turn that does auxiliary work under a different model can still be accepted as usable: models appearing in assistant events or as non-main modelUsage keys are collected into OtherModels and demoted to a warning, while only init models and the main modelUsage key fail the turn.
